From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: macbox <macbox@localhost>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 07:33:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 24/25] census probes: autoreleasepool per frame in probe_long;
 multi-file build through main.swift

probe_long faulted in the guest driver (SIGBUS) after ~4000 frames on every build, from
per-frame Metal objects never released; with the pool it ran 25339 frames clean on 300fd13.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
